---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Us" description="About Rozgar Raasta Pakistan — who we are, what we do, and how we verify every job, course and scholarship we list.">
	<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
		<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl">About Us</h1>
		<div class="prose-rrp mt-6">
			<p><strong>Rozgar Raasta Pakistan</strong> is an independent digital publication that helps Pakistanis find genuine jobs, free courses, scholarships, internships and honest career guidance.</p>
			<h2>What we do</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>We research and verify job openings, courses and scholarships against their official sources before listing them.</li>
				<li>We write practical, original guides — CV writing, interviews, freelancing, skills and online earning — in simple English with Roman Urdu explanations where helpful.</li>
				<li>We explain fees, eligibility, payment methods and risks honestly. We never promise guaranteed income or guaranteed employment.</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>What we do not do</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>We do not charge for job listings, and we never ask for CNIC, bank details or any payment to apply for a job.</li>
				<li>We do not invent jobs, salaries, deadlines or statistics.</li>
				<li>We do not copy other publishers' articles.</li>
				<li>We do not sell your personal data.</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>How we verify</h2>
			<p>Every opportunity on this site carries its original source URL and the date it was verified. If an opening closes, we mark it Closed — we never show an expired opportunity as active. If we cannot verify a specific opening, we link to the official portal instead of inventing a listing. See our <a href="/editorial-policy">Editorial Policy</a> and <a href="/corrections-policy">Corrections Policy</a>.</p>
			<h2>How we are funded</h2>
			<p>We plan to earn through legitimate advertising (Google AdSense) and clearly disclosed sponsored content and services. We never charge job seekers for listings. See <a href="/advertise">Advertise With Us</a>.</p>
			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>Questions, corrections or a tip about a fake job listing? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a> — we read every message.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
